      "lines": [
        "а) $y=x^2+2x-3$；　б) $y=\\frac{1}{2}x^2-4x+6$；",
        "в) $y=-2x^2-5x-2$；　г) $y=-x^2+6x-10$；",
        "д) $y=x^2-4x$；　е) $y=-x^2+5$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "37",
